# This repository is an ALLOW-LIST. Everything is ignored by default and each
# published file is named explicitly below.
#
# The reason is blunt: this working directory also holds full EEPROM dumps of a
# real car. Those contain the immobiliser login code (SKC), the VIN, the key
# transponder data and the odometer. A deny-list would be one typo away from
# publishing them. So: deny everything, then allow.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE

# documentation
!CLAUDE.md
!PATCH_ENGINEERING.md
!EEPROM_MAP.md
!FIELD_CHEATSHEET.md
!TEST_PLAN.md
!VDO_9N3_FIS_analysis.md

# the toolchain
!sweep.py
!emu_sweep.py
!asm65.py
!armpatch.py
!patchblock.py
!blobdis.py
!gaugecal.py
!vdo_toolkit.py
!vdo_eeprom_codec.py
!ramdiff.py
!session.sh

# build products of sweep.py, and the one-shot coding edits
!sweep_code.bin
!sweep_block.bin
!restore_block.bin
!cruise_word.bin
!revert_cruise.bin
!welcome_word.bin
!revert_welcome.bin

# NEVER: eeprom*.bin ClusterBackup*.bin VQMJ07HH_bank*.bin logs/ *.log
# NEVER: PRIVATE_VALUES.md .session_port reference/ kw1281test* dotnet-sdk-*
